<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0E1420', position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 40, width: 3, height: 44, background: '#C8A15A' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 92, top: 36, width: 860 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, color: '#E8EDF3' }}>三级验收不是三道关，是三份互不替代的证明</Text></Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 72, top: 46 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 14, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.45)' }}>02 · 三级验收</Text></Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 138, width: 236, height: 502, background: '#1B2432', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 18 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 26, lineHeight: 1.1, color: '#C8A15A' }}>L10</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.55)' }}>托盘级</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 200, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.12)', marginTop: 12, marginBottom: 16 }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)' }}>证明</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.65, color: '#E8EDF3', marginTop: 5 }}>单托盘在出厂状态下功能完整、性能达标。</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)', marginTop: 16 }}>测试域</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.62)', marginTop: 5 }}>上电时序 / 单卡压力 / 托盘内互连 / BMC 固件</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)', marginTop: 16 }}>输出物</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.62)', marginTop: 5 }}>托盘验收报告 + 序列号绑定记录</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 200, background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 12, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#C8A15A' }}>不证明</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>卡匣是否就位、72 卡 NVLink 域是否成立、机柜级液路是否连通</Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 322, top: 138, width: 236, height: 502, background: '#1B2432', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 18 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 26, lineHeight: 1.1, color: '#C8A15A' }}>L11</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.55)' }}>整机柜</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 200, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.12)', marginTop: 12, marginBottom: 16 }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)' }}>证明</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.65, color: '#E8EDF3', marginTop: 5 }}>托盘装进机柜后，互连与液路在装配态下成立。</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)', marginTop: 16 }}>测试域</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.62)', marginTop: 5 }}>NCCL all-reduce / 误码计数 / 保压与流量 / 母排压降</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)', marginTop: 16 }}>输出物</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.62)', marginTop: 5 }}>机柜验收记录 + busbw 与 #wrong 原始数据</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 200, background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 12, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#C8A15A' }}>不证明</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>跨柜传输、JCT 一致性、批次间的分布差异</Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 572, top: 138, width: 236, height: 502, background: '#1B2432', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 18 }}>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 8 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 26, lineHeight: 1.1, color: '#C8A15A' }}>L12</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.55)' }}>集群级</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 200, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.12)', marginTop: 12, marginBottom: 16 }} />

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)' }}>证明</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.65, color: '#E8EDF3', marginTop: 5 }}>多机柜协同下，作业能跑完且性能可复现。</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)', marginTop: 16 }}>测试域</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.62)', marginTop: 5 }}>跨柜 NCCL / 作业调度 / 故障注入 / 长稳运行</Text>

        <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.38)', marginTop: 16 }}>输出物</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.62)', marginTop: 5 }}>集群验收报告 + 性能基线</Text>

        <Box style={{ width: 200, background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.10)', flexDirection: 'column', padding: 12, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, letterSpacing: 2, color: '#C8A15A' }}>不证明</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.72)', marginTop: 6 }}>长期可用性、现场环境适应、量产批次一致性</Text>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 850, top: 138, width: 358, height: 502, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, letterSpacing: 3, color: '#C8A15A' }}>为什么每级都要写「不证明」</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: 32, height: 1, background: 'rgba(200,161,90,0.45)', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 20 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.55, color: '#E8EDF3' }}>缺一级，<br />就形成一个无法补偿的空洞。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.9, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.52)', marginTop: 20 }}>每一级都明确声明自己「不证明」什么，这不是谦虚，是接口定义——它告诉下一级必须接手哪些风险。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, lineHeight: 1.9, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.52)', marginTop: 14 }}>如果 L11 跳过卡匣就位检查，L12 没有任何手段能把它补回来，只能等客户现场。</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, lineHeight: 1.7, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.32)', marginTop: 'auto' }}>来源：OCP 2026《From Tray to Training Job: L10–L12 Manufacturing Test》</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 660, width: 1136, height: 1, background: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.10)' }} />
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 72, top: 678 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.35)' }}>可制造性评估维度解析</Text></Box>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 72, top: 678 }}><Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Georgia', fontSize: 14, color: 'rgba(232,237,243,0.45)' }}>06 / 16</Text></Box>

